view: data
table media(role, state)

Upload
  + media m1  role: upload | state: new

Transcode
  The job runs in the background.

  It never blocks the upload.
  > Mark it busy
    + media m2  role: copy | state: new
    ~ media m1  state: busy
  > Write the copy
        Indented deeper, still the substep's.
    ~ media m2  state: ready
  > Mark it done
    ~ media m1  state: done
    - media m2

Nothing changes
